  "scope": "Existing Number Input increment/decrement actions and Pin Input fields reassigned between owner slots without disconnecting the participant.",
  "rootCause": "ContextConsumer retains its original provider when only composed ancestry changes. The participant stays connected, so its normal disconnect/connect lifecycle does not request the new owner.",
